    <section class="org-overview-body">
        <p>What is healing, really?
        It is bringing about a new civilization: one where men who were cut off from their true selves at birth come home to who they really are.
        Circumcision has created an entire civilization of its own, woven quietly into the fabric of our society, made up of men carrying a
        wound most have never been given the language to name.
        How can we expect men to fully come into their divine masculinity
        if we do not eradicate the wound of circumcision trauma from their subconscious minds?</p>
        <p>For example, we've seen through movements like civil rights that changing laws can stop harm on the outside,
        yet the wound of racism still lives on in people's consciousness, ready to rise again.
        That's why patching the old world won't work, and why my work goes to the root: healing men from
        the inside out so a new civilization can be born.</p>
    </section>

